00:09:37.000 --> 00:10:27.000
violent. It took someone with a strong anti-social personality and a distinct lack of emotion to carry out such a heinous act. One investigator remarked, In a robbery, the motive is money. It was not necessary to kill to achieve this goal. Therefore, the question on everyone's minds was, why was Caroline Crouch killed? It was speculated that the intruders had been high on drugs and unable to control their actions. Perhaps Caroline got a decent look at them, or knew them. Caroline was also a black belt kickboxer. She might have fought back with a level of strength or skill the invaders didn't anticipate,

