00:11:45.000 --> 00:12:41.000
Caroline embraced her beachside upbringing, developing a passion for scuba diving and swimming. It was on Alonisos. during a Good Friday parade in 2017, where Caroline met and fell in love with Babas and Agnostopoulos, a handsome and successful commercial helicopter pilot. Paying tribute to his late wife, Babas said, I was lucky that I met you, very lucky that you loved me and even more lucky that you are the mother of my child. She will grow up not remembering her wonderful mother, but Caroline, who was the joy of life, will always be near me, through our daughter. Case File will be back shortly.

