cleaning lady during a home invasion. They made off with cash and other valuables. Harad Zishwili bore remarkable similarities to the composite sketch Babas had helped create. Given his Georgian roots, history of carrying out violent break-ins with a gang and his attempt to flee the country, police were confident that they had filed. finally found Caroline's killer. Georgie Haradzishwili was placed under arrest. He was interrogated for four days straight, during which he was tied up and beaten by interviewing officers.

