telling reporters. I hope what happened to me and my family and my wife's family never happens again. The police know how to do their job, and they will find them. Despite the emotional toll, Babas continued to front the media to keep his wife's case in the public consciousness. He willingly fielded questions from journalists via his Instagram account, while expressing his gratitude for the outpouring of support he was receiving from around the world. On June 17, 2021, 37 days after Caroline Crouch was killed,

